  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 504.05 Issuance of Registration Materials",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 504.05 Issuance of Registration Materials.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of an application for registration, the division or approved municipal agent shall issue a registration plate and a certificate of registration.\n\n(b) The registration plate shall conform with the requirements of Saf-C 514.\n\n(c) The certificate of registration shall reflect the information on the application for registration.\n\n(d) In order to constitute a valid certificate of registration, the certificate of registration shall be signed by the registrant.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); amd by #8999, eff 9-29-07; amd by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 504.11) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
